  "title": "Mawson's Australasian Antarctic Expedition",
  "summary": "The Australasian Antarctic Expedition, led by Douglas Mawson, sailed from Hobart in the Aurora on 2 December 1911. It set up a main base at Cape Denison on Commonwealth Bay, a western base on the Shackleton Ice Shelf and a station on Macquarie Island, and explored over 6,400 km of Antarctic land before it ended in 1914.",
