  "reviewer_note": "Least sure: the exact end date (sources give only 1914) and the Cape Denison landing day (early January 1912). The Macquarie Island party is not a waypoint because no opened page dates its landing. The Ninnis and Mertz deaths on the Far Eastern sledging journey have no sourced location.",
